| Title_1           = The Phoenix Saga, Part I: Sacrifice
| Title_2           = The Phoenix Saga, Part II: The Dark Shroud
| Title_3           = The Phoenix Saga, Part III: Cry of the Banshee
| Title_4           = The Phoenix Saga, Part IV: The Starjammers
| Title_5           = The Phoenix Saga, Part V: Child of Light
| DirectedBy        = Larry Houston
